{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breaching Harkon</strong> is a fast-paced top-down roguelike shooter with crisp pixel art and modern gunplay. Build broken weapon combos, outmaneuver deadly enemies, and fight through handcrafted arenas that remix every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Clint</strong>, a skilled operative with ties to the underworld. When ruthless billionaire Victor Harkon kidnaps your daughter, you\u2019ll have to carve a bloody path through his empire to rescue her. Every mission brings you closer \u2014 but Harkon\u2019s private army and deadly lieutenants won\u2019t make it easy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>5 dangerous areas</strong>! From smuggling yards and gambling dens to high security vaults. Each location contains unique enemies, hazards, and bosses. Levels are semi-randomized, with handcrafted rooms arranged differently every run for endless replay-ability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/3d2d2f781df7e26d47733560b55fb748.poster.avif?t=1760669517\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/3d2d2f781df7e26d47733560b55fb748.webm?t=1760669517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/3d2d2f781df7e26d47733560b55fb748.mp4?t=1760669517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons &amp; Attachments</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>65+ powerful upgrades</strong> to supercharge your run. From enhanced health and faster dashes to wild weapon mods that change how your guns fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specialist vendors</strong> appear randomly, each with exclusive gear:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One deals in unstable experimental attachments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another offers military-grade firepower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others sell rare survival gear or high-risk, high-reward mods. </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/a6b2a619d9a91eb368070a0b222bed75.poster.avif?t=1760669517\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/a6b2a619d9a91eb368070a0b222bed75.webm?t=1760669517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/a6b2a619d9a91eb368070a0b222bed75.mp4?t=1760669517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Narrative!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victor Harkon rules the state with wealth, machines, and blood. But when he takes your daughter, the fight becomes personal. As Clint, you\u2019ll breach his empire one bullet at a time until nothing stands between you and the man who stole her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/ab847a4bb2ba56e8dc4442c1e95a4191.poster.avif?t=1760669517\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/ab847a4bb2ba56e8dc4442c1e95a4191.webm?t=1760669517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/extras/ab847a4bb2ba56e8dc4442c1e95a4191.mp4?t=1760669517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3103290?t=1760669517","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3103290?t=1760669517","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/5b21ece57f73cbb74fa02aaccf6c3a5e9a9f81cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760669517","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103290/5b21ece57f73cbb74fa02aaccf6c3a5e9a9f81cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760669517","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breaching Harkon</strong> is a fast-paced top-down roguelike shooter with crisp pixel art and modern gunplay. Build broken weapon combos, outmaneuver deadly enemies, and fight through handcrafted arenas that remix every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Clint</strong>, a skilled operative with ties to the underworld. When ruthless billionaire Victor Harkon kidnaps your daughter, you\u2019ll have to carve a bloody path through his empire to rescue her. Every mission brings you closer \u2014 but Harkon\u2019s private army and deadly lieutenants won\u2019t make it easy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>5 dangerous areas</strong>! From smuggling yards and gambling dens to high security vaults. Each location contains unique enemies, hazards, and bosses. Levels are semi-randomized, with handcrafted rooms arranged differently every run for endless replay-ability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poste